| | **Impact** | Severe decline in fertilizer response ratio, soil acidification/salinization, nitrate leaching into groundwater, heightened susceptibility to foliar pests, and ₹3,500–₹7,500/ha in wasted fertilizer expenditure ([OpenAccessPub Agronomy Research](https://openaccesspub.org/agronomy-research/article/indian-agriculture-needs-a-strategic-shift-for-improving-fertilizer-response-and-overcome-sluggish-foodgrain-production-1752); [Soil Health Card Nutrient Dashboard](https://soilhealth.dac.gov.in/nutrient-dashboard)). |
